      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks to ypujante\u0027s feedback, I realized I wasn\u0027t setting any of these flags. I didn\u0027t want to make the user pass them, so I came up with this hack.\n\nOptimization and LTO are very important to us. Most of Emscripten\u0027s ports don\u0027t set these flags at all, which I find strange. Maybe Emscripten should provide suitable optimization/debug/LTO flags to ports? @sbc@google.com",
      "revId": "0303cb1c9417b1b73942ea8a41edb9228d04268d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "59b1d53d_92fef53d",
