      },
      "lineNbr": 103,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T05:42:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh I forgot to mention, the LTO flags might be totally unnecessary. I did notice that Emscripten caches these separately for `lto`/`thinlto`. But I haven\u0027t checked whether the cached library file is actually different - it seems unlikely - or if it\u0027s just getting cached in a different place. (I don\u0027t know how to check the file to see if LTO is enabled. Maybe if the build is reproducible I could just check the file hash.)",
      "parentUuid": "a2ca2113_1db0cf9d",
      "revId": "0303cb1c9417b1b73942ea8a41edb9228d04268d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c7adac75_98b1248e",
