      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-16T21:21:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case you would add `debug` variant, along the lines of the `pthread` variant that does exist in many ports.\n\nSee `variants` in variants tools/ports/sdl2.py.\n\nIMHO you might as well tie this to `setttings.ASSERTIONS`.. at least initially, rather than trying to do anything more complex.",
      "parentUuid": "43af25f5_e0a968de",
      "revId": "0303cb1c9417b1b73942ea8a41edb9228d04268d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
